  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_GLOW has the value 25</p>
  <p>PRIM_GLOW is used to get or set the glow status of the <b>face</b>. Use the integer number 25 if the compiler rejects the named constant.</p>
</p>
    </div>

